  "id": "social-image",
  "term": "social image",
  "definition": "Social image is how a person or group is believed to be seen by others in society, such as through traits or stereotypes like being viewed as frightening, oppressed, honorable, or powerful. In this context, it refers to people’s perceptions of society’s view of their own group and the emotions that can follow from that perception.",
